# 3.65.0: 안내서 「장비 강화」 — 활 · 쇠뇌 · 총과 지팡이 · 완드도 강화된다
"There is only one enhance anvil in town. Right-click it and place your gear; the panel beside it shows the odds, materials and Gold.\n\n· The result is one of success (+1), no change, damage (-1) or destruction. It gets harder as the level rises.\n· Put a guard ticket in the slot next to the item on the anvil and one is used on that attempt (it is used up whatever the result, and only one kind at a time).\n· Enhanced gear shows +N before its name and gains attack or defense. Bows, crossbows and guns raise the damage of their arrows and bullets, and staffs and wands raise spell damage, by the same share.",
